SUMMARY:PRIVATE CLASS - Residence Students - Yoga
LOCATION:Endaayaan - Tkanonsote Residence
DESCRIPTION:Note: This class is only open to students currently living in residence.\n\nStrengthen\, stretch\, and sweat in this hatha-based yoga class that incorporates meditation and breath-work with classic yoga poses. With variations offered in each pose\, you'll learn the foundations of yoga and find opportunities to challenge yourself in new ways. Suitable for all participant levels.
