SUMMARY:Group Fitness - Pride Ride
LOCATION:Studio - Cycle
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our exhilarating Pride Ride cycle class\, where we combine the energy of a high-intensity cycling workout with the vibrant spirit of celebrating diversity and pride. Get ready to sweat\, groove\, and connect with an amazing community that embraces all identities and fitness levels.
